        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen worktop, wood, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen worktop, wood, at plant
na;
UUID: 644b41db-012e-3bd7-b158-cf0011cf339c
This data set includes the materials and resources needed for producing wood kitchen countertops per m2. The worktop has a thickness of 50 mm. An average kitchen countertop has the measures of 2400 mm x 600 mm (1.44 m2). The sink is not included. Transport is estimated according to the ecoinvent standard distances for Switzerland. Linked to updated LCI of three layered laminated boards from Ecoinvent data v3.2 for KBOB recommendation 2016.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_644b41db-012e-3bd7-b158-cf0011cf339c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
